  "label": "internet meme culture audience",
  "description": "The target community is individuals familiar with internet meme culture, who appreciate humor derived from shock value, absurd juxtapositions, and crude language. The meme relies on the contrast between the professional appearance of the individuals (wearing medical scrubs) and the vulgar text overlay to create comedic effect, which is a common trope in meme creation and sharing. The audience is expected to understand the context of veterinary procedures and the irony in the text's reaction.",
